  mail: "M4 4h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Zm0 2v.4l8 5 8-5V6H4Zm16 2.9-8 5-8-5V18h16V8.9Z",
